(5544420, 800190, 54645, '<td valign="top">More like Cyan Skies! Fun photograph, and a unique perspective. Good luck!<br/> <br/>Dad: OK...is this a boy or girl turtle?<br/>Bella: girl<br/>Abby: Well, there is an awful lot black, it''s a boy!<br/>Bella: Yeah, he is a boy.<br/>Dad: Shall we name him?<br/>Bella: OK, Sylvie<br/>Abby: Boxedin <br/>Dad: Ah, Sylvie the Boxedin Turtle<br/>Abby: Why does the neck look so funny?<br/>Dad: Uh....I''m sure we will find out at rollover!</td>', 'More like Cyan Skies! Fun photograph, and a unique perspective. Good luck! Dad: OK...is this a boy or girl turtle?Bella: girlAbby: Well, there is an awful lot black, it''s a boy!Bella: Yeah, he is a boy.Dad: Shall we name him?Bella: OK, SylvieAbby: Boxedin Dad: Ah, Sylvie the Boxedin TurtleAbby: Why does the neck look so funny?Dad: Uh....I''m sure we will find out at rollover!', '2009-06-26 01:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
