(5547509, 801653, 66515, '<td valign="top">really crazy haloing from the post processing. This image has been pushed too much trying to make it something more. A well processed image doesn''t look processed in my opinion. I would however like to see what the original looked like because there is a lot of potential in the shot. <br/> <br/>In terms of the challenge it doesn''t really say "from the ground up" in my opinion. Its really a case of using the perspective not just shooting something higher than the photographer.</td>', 'really crazy haloing from the post processing. This image has been pushed too much trying to make it something more. A well processed image doesn''t look processed in my opinion. I would however like to see what the original looked like because there is a lot of potential in the shot.  In terms of the challenge it doesn''t really say "from the ground up" in my opinion. Its really a case of using the perspective not just shooting something higher than the photographer.', '2009-06-27 18:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
