(5547928, 800826, 45631, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better if you had shot from down lower instead of leaving the room at the top.  This would have given a more up sense (this tends to look like you are shooting down).  Flash is also a bit harsh. Some work in levels and saturation may have helped this image.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better if you had shot from down lower instead of leaving the room at the top.  This would have given a more up sense (this tends to look like you are shooting down).  Flash is also a bit harsh. Some work in levels and saturation may have helped this image.', '2009-06-28 00:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5547934, 800653, 45631, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t come across as ''from the ground up'' for me.  More of a landscape perspective whose subject matter doesn''t hold interest. Would like to see a more vertical aspect from the camera for this challenge.</td>', 'This doesn''t come across as ''from the ground up'' for me.  More of a landscape perspective whose subject matter doesn''t hold interest. Would like to see a more vertical aspect from the camera for this challenge.', '2009-06-28 00:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
