(5547945, 800984, 45631, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of direct statue pictures don''t mind if they are used as part of composing a bigger picture.  For example... maybe the same statue with a person kneeling at the bottom of it shot with the camera on the ground catching the person praying and the statue up higher (hope you get what I mean).  Spend a little more time composing your shot and get creative.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of direct statue pictures don''t mind if they are used as part of composing a bigger picture.  For example... maybe the same statue with a person kneeling at the bottom of it shot with the camera on the ground catching the person praying and the statue up higher (hope you get what I mean).  Spend a little more time composing your shot and get creative.', '2009-06-28 00:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5547948, 801270, 45631, '<td valign="top">OK, this looks like the same pic as someone else entered (the other was way blown out).  This is still over exposed (watch for the blinkies on your preview).  A bit of levels, saturation and sharpness may have helped this particular image.</td>', 'OK, this looks like the same pic as someone else entered (the other was way blown out).  This is still over exposed (watch for the blinkies on your preview).  A bit of levels, saturation and sharpness may have helped this particular image.', '2009-06-28 00:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
