(5550178, 801489, 90754, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been a fan of the black and whites but I like this.  The dark clouds.  Give it an ominous stormy sort of feeling.  I can''t decide whether the tree(s) on the left is/are distracting or a nice frame.</td>', 'I haven''t been a fan of the black and whites but I like this.  The dark clouds.  Give it an ominous stormy sort of feeling.  I can''t decide whether the tree(s) on the left is/are distracting or a nice frame.', '2009-06-29 21:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5550181, 801396, 90754, '<td valign="top">Love this.  I would have cropped it tighter lengthwise but I really do like this.  I like the color and the silhouette.</td>', 'Love this.  I would have cropped it tighter lengthwise but I really do like this.  I like the color and the silhouette.', '2009-06-29 21:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5550182, 801364, 90754, '<td valign="top">Good color.  Nice perspective.</td>', 'Good color.  Nice perspective.', '2009-06-29 21:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5550183, 801535, 90754, '<td valign="top">I love the curve and the texture.</td>', 'I love the curve and the texture.', '2009-06-29 21:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5550186, 801331, 90754, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to some day experience this feeling on my own.  My jumps are very little compared to that.  I like the perspective but the out of focus dirt is distracting and the photo feels very grainy.</td>', 'I can''t wait to some day experience this feeling on my own.  My jumps are very little compared to that.  I like the perspective but the out of focus dirt is distracting and the photo feels very grainy.', '2009-06-29 21:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5550187, 801058, 90754, '<td valign="top">This title is cracking me up!  I love it.</td>', 'This title is cracking me up!  I love it.', '2009-06-29 21:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5550189, 801437, 90754, '<td valign="top">The color is a little flat to me but I like the perspective and the orange.</td>', 'The color is a little flat to me but I like the perspective and the orange.', '2009-06-29 21:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5550191, 800804, 90754, '<td valign="top">Something about the color is off for me.  Too dark perhaps?  Good perspective.  Perhaps a tighter crop.  I like the symmetry of the middle row.</td>', 'Something about the color is off for me.  Too dark perhaps?  Good perspective.  Perhaps a tighter crop.  I like the symmetry of the middle row.', '2009-06-29 21:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
