(5552002, 800598, 94235, '<td valign="top">Wow, a technically okay photo thwarted by the prude vote!<br/> <br/>I guess if it is not a photo of trees, buildings or the underside of plants it is not going to score well in this sort of challenge.<br/>Says a lot for originality (and some narrow minds) on this site.<br/> <br/>Thanks to the voters and commenters who took my entry in the comical sense in which it was intended.   <br/>To all the other prudes I apologize for the offense.  <br/>If an original picture, done with a humorous title and the subject being something that occurs in millions of households around the world, is a problem to you, well I am glad I am not living with your affliction. <br/>Get yourselves a sense of humor.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-09-15 19:14:41.</i></td>', 'Wow, a technically okay photo thwarted by the prude vote! I guess if it is not a photo of trees, buildings or the underside of plants it is not going to score well in this sort of challenge.Says a lot for originality (and some narrow minds) on this site. Thanks to the voters and commenters who took my entry in the comical sense in which it was intended.   To all the other prudes I apologize for the offense.  If an original picture, done with a humorous title and the subject being something that occurs in millions of households around the world, is a problem to you, well I am glad I am not living with your affliction. Get yourselves a sense of humor.', '2009-07-01 01:27:01.000000', '2011-09-15 20:14:41.000000', 0),
