(5553254, 801690, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>luminous, mysterious, intriguing</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!luminous, mysterious, intriguing', '2009-07-01 13:22:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5553259, 801426, 43774, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mpeters:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice one Judi! This really caught my eye when going through the challenge. I''ll bet the noisy comment wasn''t talking about digital noise... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, I am thinking they meant "busy", not noisy as in grain or digital noise.</td>', 'Originally posted by mpeters: Nice one Judi! This really caught my eye when going through the challenge. I''ll bet the noisy comment wasn''t talking about digital noise...   Yeah, I am thinking they meant "busy", not noisy as in grain or digital noise.', '2009-07-01 13:22:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5553260, 801181, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>Very nicely done--mood, tone, offset composition--well done!</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!Very nicely done--mood, tone, offset composition--well done!', '2009-07-01 13:22:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5553268, 801712, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>Beautiful conversion, tonality, texture, composition--wonderful presentation with balanced light and (exactly right) darkness.  Well Seen, Well Executed.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!Beautiful conversion, tonality, texture, composition--wonderful presentation with balanced light and (exactly right) darkness.  Well Seen, Well Executed.', '2009-07-01 13:24:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5553277, 801530, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>I love this, and your atypical composition (as opposed to the standard centered-dome) with the pillar at the top left adds a unique tension which really makes this work.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!I love this, and your atypical composition (as opposed to the standard centered-dome) with the pillar at the top left adds a unique tension which really makes this work.', '2009-07-01 13:26:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5553287, 800501, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>Wonderful b/w conversion, beautiful abstraction!  Thank you for the offset composition--nicely seen.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!Wonderful b/w conversion, beautiful abstraction!  Thank you for the offset composition--nicely seen.', '2009-07-01 13:27:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5553303, 801619, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/> <br/>Luminous, beautiful form and composition--I half expect to see the girl from Henri Cartier-Bresson''s "running up the stairs" Siphnos, Greece image to come flying around from the right side.  I enjoy the waiting for her to appear :-)</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER! Luminous, beautiful form and composition--I half expect to see the girl from Henri Cartier-Bresson''s "running up the stairs" Siphnos, Greece image to come flying around from the right side.  I enjoy the waiting for her to appear :-)', '2009-07-01 13:32:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5553309, 801426, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>Neither noisy nor busy, but a beautiful shallow-dof ballet of an image--can almost hear the music, feel the breeze, smell the grass</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!Neither noisy nor busy, but a beautiful shallow-dof ballet of an image--can almost hear the music, feel the breeze, smell the grass', '2009-07-01 13:35:01.000000', NULL, 0),
