(5556741, 800636, 67145, '<td valign="top">wottha !!??<br/>i was admiring your beautiful bird and refreshed the page .. when it had refreshed you beautiful bird had gone .. <br/>sandy that really sucks .. <br/>its so easy to forget when doing a basic edit that you cant do blending modes .. we do them without thinking a lot of the time ..  a couple of times i''ve done a process and actually submitted it .. got it back up in photoshop later &amp; see that i''ve done a blending mode other than normal without realising it .. <br/>anyway .. like andrew says .. a fabulous shot is a fabulous shot no matter wot .. <br/>sending a great big hug .. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'wottha !!??i was admiring your beautiful bird and refreshed the page .. when it had refreshed you beautiful bird had gone .. sandy that really sucks .. its so easy to forget when doing a basic edit that you cant do blending modes .. we do them without thinking a lot of the time ..  a couple of times i''ve done a process and actually submitted it .. got it back up in photoshop later & see that i''ve done a blending mode other than normal without realising it .. anyway .. like andrew says .. a fabulous shot is a fabulous shot no matter wot .. sending a great big hug .. :) ', '2009-07-02 21:56:38.000000', NULL, 0),
