(5557383, 800636, 44877, '<td valign="top">You know - if this is DQ''d based on a mistake in your explanation, SC should maybe revisit this decision.<br/> <br/>Say if you HAD done something illegal and had typed it up as if you didn''t, they''d take your word for it? Hardly. Therefore, if you SAID you did something illegal, but didn''t, I would hope they will take another look and ascertain what editing steps actually went into the image. <br/> <br/>So sorry for the stress around this DQ, Sandy.</td>', 'You know - if this is DQ''d based on a mistake in your explanation, SC should maybe revisit this decision. Say if you HAD done something illegal and had typed it up as if you didn''t, they''d take your word for it? Hardly. Therefore, if you SAID you did something illegal, but didn''t, I would hope they will take another look and ascertain what editing steps actually went into the image.  So sorry for the stress around this DQ, Sandy.', '2009-07-03 01:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
