(5558081, 801426, 56744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by IWhispered:</b></div><hr/><i> Love the flowers.  Like the angle.  But it is a tad noisy and all over the place for me. My eyes don''t know what to focus on. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>This is a big problem for a lot of DPCers, but try to close your eyes and all the image will be on focus. You''ll see the amazing beauty of this photograph</td>', 'Originally posted by IWhispered: Love the flowers.  Like the angle.  But it is a tad noisy and all over the place for me. My eyes don''t know what to focus on.  This is a big problem for a lot of DPCers, but try to close your eyes and all the image will be on focus. You''ll see the amazing beauty of this photograph', '2009-07-03 17:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5558178, 800636, 20608, '<td valign="top">Sandy, I have done the same thing with my editing and used the wrong terminology and got DQ''d, I did not bother to contact SC about it because I figured I would not of been believed but I think that you should as you are such an upstanding member of DPC and I am certain the mistake is genuine.</td>', 'Sandy, I have done the same thing with my editing and used the wrong terminology and got DQ''d, I did not bother to contact SC about it because I figured I would not of been believed but I think that you should as you are such an upstanding member of DPC and I am certain the mistake is genuine.', '2009-07-03 18:59:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5558226, 800636, 3746, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MAK:</b></div><hr/><i> Sandy, I have done the same thing with my editing and used the wrong terminology and got DQ''d, I did not bother to contact SC about it because I figured I would not of been believed but I think that you should as you are such an upstanding member of DPC and I am certain the mistake is genuine. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Agree with MAK here, if its only down to an incorrect explanation then maybe you should ask for them to reconsider.</td>', 'Originally posted by MAK: Sandy, I have done the same thing with my editing and used the wrong terminology and got DQ''d, I did not bother to contact SC about it because I figured I would not of been believed but I think that you should as you are such an upstanding member of DPC and I am certain the mistake is genuine.   Agree with MAK here, if its only down to an incorrect explanation then maybe you should ask for them to reconsider.', '2009-07-03 19:38:22.000000', NULL, 0),
