(5558529, 801365, 88580, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jutilda:</b></div><hr/><i> Isn''t it amazing how different things look from a different perspective. I like the angles.  Wish the building were as focused as the lines and the street lamp. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah....  The "building" is actually the pole that the light is mounted to.  It''s not nearly as big as it looks.</td>', 'Originally posted by Jutilda: Isn''t it amazing how different things look from a different perspective. I like the angles.  Wish the building were as focused as the lines and the street lamp.   Yeah....  The "building" is actually the pole that the light is mounted to.  It''s not nearly as big as it looks.', '2009-07-03 23:44:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5558653, 800636, 66384, '<td valign="top">So sorry about your DQ. That really hurts when it is just a silly mistake during validation. I wish it hadn''t happened. But you have a lot of ribbons, and you have the knowledge that this deserved a ribbon, and you have a lot of FAVs, so it isn''t all that bad. BTW, I wish I could capture that clarity in an overhead motion shot.</td>', 'So sorry about your DQ. That really hurts when it is just a silly mistake during validation. I wish it hadn''t happened. But you have a lot of ribbons, and you have the knowledge that this deserved a ribbon, and you have a lot of FAVs, so it isn''t all that bad. BTW, I wish I could capture that clarity in an overhead motion shot.', '2009-07-04 01:08:39.000000', NULL, 0),
