(5567948, 800636, 80096, '<td valign="top">What a shame, this is sooo well done! I really feel bad for you Sandy and understand just how you must feel. But, if anything has been learned here it would probably be that we should all be careful of what we put in our editing details because it just might DQ us. Don''t let this stand in your way, you are a gifted photographer and I know you will continue to create amazing images!</td>', 'What a shame, this is sooo well done! I really feel bad for you Sandy and understand just how you must feel. But, if anything has been learned here it would probably be that we should all be careful of what we put in our editing details because it just might DQ us. Don''t let this stand in your way, you are a gifted photographer and I know you will continue to create amazing images!', '2009-07-10 12:23:42.000000', NULL, 0),
