(5578434, 801588, 47906, '<td valign="top">Great color from the planes and the colors also make for great lines leading into the photo giving a great feeling of depth to your photo. I think you could have added a bit more punch to the colors using the hue and Sat tool, it would have brightened it up a little bit more, but Very nicely captured overall.</td>', 'Great color from the planes and the colors also make for great lines leading into the photo giving a great feeling of depth to your photo. I think you could have added a bit more punch to the colors using the hue and Sat tool, it would have brightened it up a little bit more, but Very nicely captured overall.', '2009-07-18 12:45:08.000000', NULL, 0),
